DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssxxiippiioo driver provides support for the GPIO controller integrated in
     Allwinner Technology A10, A10s, A13, A20, A23, A33, A64, A80, GR8, H3, H5
     and R40 SoCs.  The devices have several ports for multi-functional pins
     which can be configured as either inputs or outputs, and accessed using
     gpioctl(8).

